%% title: Notification Delivery Lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PENDING : NotificationRequest consumed\nINSERT notifications

  PENDING --> SENT : delivery succeeded\n(SMTP ACK / FCM success)

  PENDING --> FAILED : delivery error\n(SMTP reject / FCM error / timeout)

  FAILED --> PENDING : outbox retry\n(attempt_count++)

  FAILED --> BOUNCED : max retries exceeded\nor hard bounce

  SENT --> [*]
  BOUNCED --> [*]

  state "dispatch_control_log" as DCL {
    [*] --> RUNNING : default state
    RUNNING --> HALTED : POST /ops/dispatch/halt\n(single actor, deferred review)
    HALTED --> RUNNING : four-eyes approve\n(dispatch_resume_proposal APPROVED)
  }

  note right of PENDING
    While HALTED: outbox dispatcher
    pauses; rows stay PENDING.
    No messages are lost.
  end note
